REGULATORY COMPLIANCE:

Users are responsible for ensuring compliance with:

- FCC regulations (United States)
- CE regulations (European Union)
- Local drone registration requirements
- Pilot certification requirements (if applicable)
- No-fly zone restrictions
- Privacy laws regarding aerial photography
- Insurance requirements

This project uses 2.4GHz radio communication. Users must ensure their
equipment complies with local regulations regarding radio frequency emissions.

